Package: MRMU
Title: Mendelian Randomization With Multiple Unmeasured Confounders
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Xianghong", family = "Hu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "maxhu@ust.hk")
Author: Xianghong Hu
Maintainer: Xianghong Hu <maxhu@ust.hk>
Description: Implements MR-MU methods for Mendelian randomization analyses with
    multiple exposures/confounders using GWAS summary statistics. The package
    includes tools for harmonising summary data, constructing MR-MU inputs,
    estimating LDSC-based nuisance parameters, and fitting the variational EM
    model.
